  "title": "Turing Labs Unveils AI Platform to Help Companies Navigate Evolving Ingredient Regulations",
  "summary": "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Turing Labs Inc. today launched an enhanced AI-powered platform designed to help food and beverage manufacturers swiftly adapt to changing regulations, with immediate application for the upcoming FDA ban on Red Dye No. 3. This solution addresses the growing challenge companies face as regulatory changes accelerate globally. ‍",
